B.Gl=new A.he("You\u2019re meeting the ball a bit low \u2014 move your feet so it\u2019s around waist height when you hit.","You\u2019re meeting the ball very low \u2014 set your feet earlier and take it between waist and chest.","You\u2019re meeting the ball a bit high \u2014 step back to let it drop, or move in to take it earlier.","You\u2019re meeting the ball very high \u2014 step back so it drops into your waist-to-chest zone, or take it earlier on the rise.","Good contact height \u2014 right in your strike zone.")
